# TypoScript: TYPO3 TypoScript reference (13.x): syntax; requirements/languages/typoscript.md
name     typoscript typo3
keyword  page config lib plugin tt_content TEXT COA FLUIDTEMPLATE CONTENT IMAGE HMENU USER
keyword  includeLibs includeCSS includeJS
builtin  TSFE GP DB LLL
ident-part     .-_
line-comment   # //
block-comment  /* */
operators  =<>{}()[]:
